#: ../../source/model-zoo/index.md:9 cf242dac078e4b9dbc8ac53785277b21
msgid ""
"从模型论文出发，查阅摘要与作者公开的实现。如需横向对比各模型在主流公开数据集上的 5 "
"折基准表现，请查阅[基准排行榜](../evaluation/leaderboard.md)。选择模型后，可前往[训练指南](../user-"
"guides/training.md)运行实验，或阅读[开发者指南](../developer-guides/customize-"
"model.md)了解接入方式。"
msgstr ""
"Start from model papers to explore abstracts and authors' open-source "
"implementations. To compare the 5-fold benchmark performance of models "
"across mainstream public datasets, please consult the [Benchmark "
"Leaderboard](../evaluation/leaderboard.md). After selecting a model, "
"proceed to the [Training Guide](../user-guides/training.md) to run "
"experiments, or read the [Developer Guides](../developer-guides"
"/customize-model.md) to learn how to integrate new models."

